  "bio": "Step into the retro vibe of Stay Free Tattoo Berlin, where the time-honored art of traditional tattooing reigns supreme. Nestled in the heart of Berlin, our parlor welcomes walk-ins from Monday to Saturday, 14-18, offering you a chance to get inked by our distinguished artists, like Sindy Melo and Marcos Ortega, on the spur of the moment. Embrace the spirit of freedom and individual expression in an environment that’s as authentic as the designs etched onto your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berlin, Berlin, Germany"
